{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type GenerationActivity = \n  | \"chat\"\n  | \"image\"\n  | \"video\"\n  | \"audio\"\n  | \"tts\"\n  | \"voice\"\n  | \"transcription\"\n  | \"embedding\"\n  | \"rerank\"\n  | \"evaluate\"\n  | \"summarize\"\n  | \"world\"\n  | \"liveVideo\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/middleware/types.ts#L37","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/middleware/types.ts:37"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The activity an observability event describes."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Mirrors the public surface a caller reaches for: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'chat'"},{"type":"text","value":" for "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chat()"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'summarize'"},{"type":"text","value":" for "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"summarize()"},{"type":"text","value":", and the media kinds for the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"generate*"},{"type":"text","value":"\nactivities. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'tts'"},{"type":"text","value":" matches the speech adapter's kind (the public\ndiscriminator avoids inventing a parallel "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'speech'"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'text'"},{"type":"text","value":" vocabulary).\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"otelMiddleware"},{"type":"text","value":" maps each to its "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"gen_ai.operation.name"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'summarize'"},{"type":"text","value":" produces text, not media, so it has no artifacts — a\npersistence middleware stores its run record and result and nothing else."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype GenerationActivity = \n  | \"chat\"\n  | \"image\"\n  | \"video\"\n  | \"audio\"\n  | \"tts\"\n  | \"voice\"\n  | \"transcription\"\n  | \"embedding\"\n  | \"rerank\"\n  | \"evaluate\"\n  | \"summarize\"\n  | \"world\"\n  | \"liveVideo\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/middleware/types.ts:37](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/middleware/types.ts#L37)\n\nThe activity an observability event describes.\n\nMirrors the public surface a caller reaches for: `'chat'` for `chat()`,\n`'summarize'` for `summarize()`, and the media kinds for the `generate*`\nactivities. `'tts'` matches the speech adapter's kind (the public\ndiscriminator avoids inventing a parallel `'speech'`/`'text'` vocabulary).\n`otelMiddleware` maps each to its `gen_ai.operation.name`.\n\n`'summarize'` produces text, not media, so it has no artifacts — a\npersistence middleware stores its run record and result and nothing else.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: GenerationActivity\ntitle: GenerationActivity\n---\n\n```ts\ntype GenerationActivity = \n  | \"chat\"\n  | \"image\"\n  | \"video\"\n  | \"audio\"\n  | \"tts\"\n  | \"voice\"\n  | \"transcription\"\n  | \"embedding\"\n  | \"rerank\"\n  | \"evaluate\"\n  | \"summarize\"\n  | \"world\"\n  | \"liveVideo\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/middleware/types.ts:37](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/middleware/types.ts#L37)\n\nThe activity an observability event describes.\n\nMirrors the public surface a caller reaches for: `'chat'` for `chat()`,\n`'summarize'` for `summarize()`, and the media kinds for the `generate*`\nactivities. `'tts'` matches the speech adapter's kind (the public\ndiscriminator avoids inventing a parallel `'speech'`/`'text'` vocabulary).\n`otelMiddleware` maps each to its `gen_ai.operation.name`.\n\n`'summarize'` produces text, not media, so it has no artifacts — a\npersistence middleware stores its run record and result and nothing else.\n"}
